    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Find a run across signals",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 40
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Copy the **Trace ID** from the diagnosis interface, then use **Explore \u2192 Tempo \u2192 TraceQL** with `{ trace:id = \"<trace_id>\" }`, or search `{ resource.service.name = \"worker\" && span.lab.run_id = \"<run_id>\" }`.\n\nOn the host: `make logs RUN_ID=<run_id>` returns correlated JSON logs. Logs remain in Kubernetes; this stack does not include Loki.\n\nTelemetry storage is temporary. Prometheus retention: **24 hours / 256 MB**; Tempo retention: **1 hour**. Application history remains in PostgreSQL."
      }
